    RefIds:
    - rid: 1123138610053513240
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: A message brought home
        text: You tell the fox what the moth saw. He sets down his cup. Alive, then. Beyond the old bridge. You have brought back more than a rumor.
        continueLabel: Ask about the bridge
        duration: 1
        hostState: 0
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 74eb1ce65d124aa9823839f4404df802, type: 2}
        transition: 0
        charm: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 1123138610053513241
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: The far arch
        text: That bridge marks a boundary. Beyond it, a familiar voice can lead you astray. Remember who sent you, and do not follow a light merely because it waits.
        continueLabel: Ask for help
        duration: 1
        hostState: 0
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
        transition: 0
        charm: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 1123138610053513242
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: Protection for the road
        text: Take {charm}. It will provide you shelter for the road ahead.
        continueLabel: Take the second charm
        duration: 1
        hostState: 0
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
        transition: 0
        charm: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c9c616a498b9c264a9a9394603f4577f, type: 2}
    - rid: 1123138610053513243
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: A mark to remember
        text: And take {charm}. When the road grows strange, let it remind you where you stand.
        continueLabel: Prepare for the crossing
        duration: 1
        hostState: 0
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
        transition: 0
        charm: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0703508354705dd4b8fc8ba48c2ca01e, type: 2}
    - rid: 1123138610053513244
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: Gifts for the old road
        text: These marks belong to you now. When a spirit offers them, you may call upon them. There are other charms in each family; keep watch for those as you travel.
        continueLabel: Finish the preparations
        duration: 1
        hostState: 0
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
        transition: 0
        charm: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 1123138610053513245
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: Chapter 1 complete
        text: The traveler is alive. You know where the old road crosses the boundary, and the fox has helped you prepare. The next chapter lies beyond the bridge.
        continueLabel: Return to the trail
        duration: 1
        hostState: 0
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
        transition: 0
        charm: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 1123138610053513246
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: Chapter 1 complete
        text: The traveler is alive beyond the old bridge. The fox's gifts are yours. You are ready for the next crossing, in Chapter 2.
